# Central image: Wren's savings are little rubber-hose coins stuck in a bank WAITING ROOM. Across a canyon is MARKET STREET,
# five hundred busy shopfronts. Between them hangs a rope footbridge with FIVE PLANKS (the five steps).
# Kept distinct from video 22 (the detailed order of operations: match, debt, tax accounts): here it is the mindset + first path.
# Cast (all made up): WREN (29, dental hygienist, label-maker saver), DIME (her oldest savings coin, bored, plays cards),
# MORT (teller at Big Marble Bank, kind, pays 0.01%), GRANDPA ABE (keeps money in a coffee can), RICO (Wren's coworker, options + coin gambler),
# + regulars PIP, DOT, GUS. N = narrator. Stromi mascot appears in Your Wallet.
